OL,3,GNEWSAGadd's debt to Edinburgh: 'You
OL,4,Aarrive with an idea and leave with a
OL,5,Acareer'
OL,6,
OL,7,FRichard Gadd says he owes everything to
OL,8,Fthe Edinburgh Festival Fringe.
OL,10,FHis show Baby Reindeer, a dark comedy
OL,11,Fabout his experience of a stalker, won
OL,12,Fa string of awards, and enjoyed a
OL,13,Fsell-out run in Edinburgh before
OL,14,Ftransferring to the London stage.
OL,16,FBut it was the arrival of executives
OL,17,Ffrom the TV Festival in the final week
OL,18,Fof August in 2019, which took his
OL,19,Fcareer on a whole new trajectory.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
