OL,3,GNEWSAGadd's debt to Edinburgh: 'You
OL,4,Aarrive with an idea and leave with a
OL,5,Acareer'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The show had sold out before the
OL,8,Ffestival had even begun," he told a
OL,9,Fgathering at a Screen Scotland event to
OL,10,Flaunch a new TV festival.
